<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
warrant liabilities, derivative liability, and investment options are all classified as Level 3, for which there is no current market
for these securities such as the determination of fair value requires significant judgment or estimation. Changes in fair value measurement
categorized within Level 3 of the fair value hierarchy are analyzed each period based on changes in estimates or assumptions and recorded
as appropriate.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


