    Pharma Merger Sub, Inc., Jay Pharma Inc., 1236567 B.C. Unlimited Liability Company and Barry Kostiner, as the Ameri representative
    (incorporated by reference to Exhibit 10.1 to the Company&#8217;s Current Report on Form 8-K, filed with the Commission on August
